        "publishTime": "2026-07-21T09:01:22.627534996Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2preVltNUdUV1J2TTBFMlpFSndaMmcxYUZscVlXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2preVltNUdUV1J2TTBFMlpFSndaMmcxYUZscVlXYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404076fd87830ff:0x3908715249d29d3d"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_zB42G8HBDQRPZ3SSVJxCDk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vMmIxbFNSRlpRYTBSbFdpMWhjMjl3VFhkUFJHYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "極度差劣、毫無制度的混亂餐廳！作為持牌的寵物友善餐廳，現場的行政管理簡直是一場災難。店內完全沒有清晰劃分「寵物用餐區」與「一般客人區域」，更沒有任何職員在門口維持秩序或進行帶位！現場有多個空置座位，客人自行入座後，職員不但完全沒有任何基本招待，甚至連客人多次示意點單都採取「完全無視」的傲慢態度。更離譜的是，由於缺乏員工引導與提示，放任現場個別盲目的寵物主人對其他正常用餐的客人進行無禮的眼神挑釁與注視，員工對此竟然不聞不問！嗌單無人理、前線無人帶位、環境缺乏防護分區、零招待。如果你們根本沒有能力管理好寵物友善的行政配套，就不要盲目申請牌照來內耗普通客人的精神！一星都嫌多，絕對不會再光顧，等著被市場與口碑徹底止蝕。\n\nHorrible Management & Non-existent Customer Service! Absolute Chaos!As a licensed pet-friendly establishment, their handling of seating and pet boundaries is a complete disaster. There is NO clear segregation between the pet-designated area and the regular dining zone.The staff are completely invisible. There is no host at the door to provide seating assistance or guidance. When I seated myself at an empty table, the waiters intentionally ignored multiple requests to take my order. Worse still, due to the total lack of staff intervention, some dog owners were left free to stare at other customers aggressively without anyone stepping in to defuse the tension.Total lack of hospitality, ignored orders, and zero professional guidance. If your management is incapable of implementing basic regulations, do not open a pet-friendly business. Avoid this place at all costs. 1 star is a massive overstatement.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
